+# Security policy
+
+## Reporting a vulnerability
+
+Report it privately: open the repository's **Security** tab and choose **Report a vulnerability**. Please do not open a public issue.
+
+This is a personal project maintained by one person. Expect an acknowledgement within 7 days. There is no bounty.
+
+## Supported versions
+
+Only the default branch is supported.
